<p><strong>Create unique house interiors with this free 16x16 asset pack!</strong><strong></strong><strong><br></strong></p>
<figure><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIyNzc4NTIyLmdpZg==/original/vLOJFP.gif" loading="lazy"></figure>
<p>Featuring the essentials for kitchens, hallways, and living rooms, every item comes in multiple color variations&mdash;allowing you to design in a wide range of styles, from modern and sleek to cozy and rustic. With endless combinations, you can bring warmth, personality, and variety to your projects with ease!</p>
<figure><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIyNzc3OTU1LmdpZg==/original/qsW7YZ.gif" loading="lazy"><br><br>Free or pay what you want - every support helps me create more packs.<br>I’d really appreciate your <strong>feedback</strong> and a <strong>rating</strong>!<br><br><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIyNzkyNDQ3LmdpZg==/original/%2FLOkjK.gif" loading="lazy"><br><br>Looking for more? Check out my other asset packs.</figure>
